  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improved Rural Roads and Transport Services for Communities in Low Income Countries.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#x2018;To develop knowledge and evidence with up to 17 partner Governments for 1) planning, designing, constructing and maintaining cost effective and reliable low volume roads and 2) planning and delivering appropriate rural transport services. At least 110,000km low volume rural roads influenced by project research by 2030 which  will improve the livelihoods of poor men and women through providing increased access to markets and services.&#x2019;</narrative>
  </description>
